    <string name="oem_header">Manufacturer settings</string>
    <string name="oem_intro">Some manufacturers stop background apps beyond Android\'s rules. If the connection drops when the screen is off:</string>
    <string name="oem_xiaomi">Xiaomi / HyperOS: App info → Autostart on; Battery saver → No restrictions.</string>
    <string name="oem_huawei">Huawei / Honor: Battery → App launch → MediaDuet → Manage manually (all on).</string>
    <string name="oem_oppo">OPPO / OnePlus / realme: App info → Battery usage → Allow background activity and auto launch.</string>
    <string name="oem_vivo">vivo / iQOO: Battery → Background power consumption → Allow.</string>
    <string name="oem_samsung">Samsung: Battery → Background usage limits → add MediaDuet to “Never sleeping apps”.</string>
    <string name="oem_pixel">Pixel / stock Android: Battery → Unrestricted is enough.</string>

